1
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,058
Oprosti, Nagisa.

2
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,893
Sjetila sam se da moram nešto učiniti.

3
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:22,313
U redu, kužim.

4
00:00:27,026 --> 00:00:30,321
{\an8}PRIVATNA SREDNJA ŠKOLA EIMEI

5
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:55,096
UKRASI

6
00:01:26,711 --> 00:01:28,712
Nasmrt si me prepala!

7
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:30,589
Ne plaši me tako!

8
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:34,176
- Oprosti.
- Mislio sam da si duh.

9
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:36,012
Zašto ne Djed Božićnjak?

10
00:01:36,638 --> 00:01:37,514
Što?

11
00:01:47,106 --> 00:01:50,192
Čekaj, otkud ti ovdje?

12
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:51,528
Kako je bilo na utakmici?

13
00:01:53,613 --> 00:01:55,281
Prošle smo prvi krug.

14
00:01:56,866 --> 00:01:58,284
Čestitam.

15
00:01:59,077 --> 00:02:00,286
Hvala.

16
00:02:00,912 --> 00:02:03,289
I hvala ti na ulaznici.

17
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:09,337
Zahvaljujući tebi
pomirila sam se s Yumekom.

18
00:02:13,925 --> 00:02:17,804
Čula sam da si morao puno trčati
da osvojiš tu ulaznicu.

19
00:02:18,304 --> 00:02:19,388
Molim?

20
00:02:19,389 --> 00:02:21,307
Ma nije to ništa!

21
00:02:21,891 --> 00:02:23,685
Samo lagana tjelovježba.

22
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:29,482
Zapravo sam već dugo znala

23
00:02:30,775 --> 00:02:33,528
<i>da Yumeku nešto muči.</i>

24
00:02:34,946 --> 00:02:40,410
Ali nisam joj ništa rekla
jer nije to nikad spominjala.

25
00:02:56,509 --> 00:02:58,553
Bilo mi je jako žao zbog toga.

26
00:02:59,053 --> 00:03:04,100
Danas sam se uspjela uhvatiti u koštac
s dijelom te tuge.

27
00:03:05,268 --> 00:03:09,439
Stvarno sam ti zahvalna, Taiki.

28
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:16,821
Iz dubine duše.

29
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:23,953
Ne moraš... mi zahvaljivati.

30
00:03:29,876 --> 00:03:34,297
Baš kao što je Yumeka utjecala na tebe,

31
00:03:35,423 --> 00:03:38,676
ti si utjecala na mene.

32
00:03:40,386 --> 00:03:42,430
Samo sam ti uzvratio uslugu!

33
00:04:36,025 --> 00:04:37,151
Hvala ti.

34
00:05:07,515 --> 00:05:08,433
Oprosti.

35
00:05:14,772 --> 00:05:15,940
Daj da te samo...

36
00:05:17,358 --> 00:05:18,860
neko vrijeme grlim.

37
00:05:57,482 --> 00:06:01,652
PLAVA KUTIJA
DRUGA SEZONA

38
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:28,656
31. EPIZODA
BADNJAK

39
00:08:23,461 --> 00:08:24,462
Hvala ti.

40
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,176
Nema na čemu.

41
00:08:44,357 --> 00:08:45,358
Hej...

42
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:47,485
Chinatsu Senpai...

43
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:54,992
Moramo krenuti.

44
00:08:56,911 --> 00:08:57,995
Što?

45
00:09:03,334 --> 00:09:04,669
Chinatsu?

46
00:09:13,052 --> 00:09:15,638
<i>Što je to bilo?</i>

47
00:09:17,515 --> 00:09:19,725
<i>Zagrlila me!</i>

48
00:09:21,477 --> 00:09:24,063
<i>Još osjećam njezinu toplinu
na svom ramenu.</i>

49
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:32,737
<i>Možda je nervozna
zbog nadolazeće utakmice,</i>

50
00:09:32,738 --> 00:09:34,991
<i>pa je htjela da je netko umiri.</i>

51
00:09:35,992 --> 00:09:39,412
<i>Ili su je obuzele emocije</i>

52
00:09:39,996 --> 00:09:41,789
<i>jer se pomirila s Yumekom?</i>

53
00:09:43,124 --> 00:09:44,166
<i>Ili možda...</i>

54
00:09:47,044 --> 00:09:48,378
Hej, Taiki!

55
00:09:48,379 --> 00:09:50,298
Dođi!

56
00:09:56,971 --> 00:09:58,389
<i>Je li moguće?</i>

57
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:37,678
Mama! Gdje je Chinatsu Senpai?

58
00:10:38,387 --> 00:10:40,097
Davno je otišla.

59
00:10:40,890 --> 00:10:43,017
U 13 h igra utakmicu drugog kruga.

60
00:10:43,851 --> 00:10:45,185
Shvaćam.

61
00:10:45,186 --> 00:10:47,687
Nemaš li danas trening?

62
00:10:47,688 --> 00:10:49,606
Požuri se da se stigneš spremiti.

63
00:10:49,607 --> 00:10:50,858
Dobro.

64
00:11:04,205 --> 00:11:07,458
- Zašto izgledaš tako odsutno?
- Ma nije mi ništa!

65
00:11:08,584 --> 00:11:10,211
Moram do klupske prostorije!

66
00:11:18,135 --> 00:11:21,263
<i>Stalno razmišljam o onome jučer.</i>

67
00:11:25,351 --> 00:11:29,897
<i>Htio sam je pitati više o Yumeki.</i>

68
00:11:30,689 --> 00:11:34,527
<i>Hoće li se, sad kad su se pomirile,
Yumeka vratiti košarci?</i>

69
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:39,156
<i>To bi sigurno usrećilo Chinatsu Senpai.</i>

70
00:11:40,991 --> 00:11:42,368
<i>Dovoljno da me...</i>

71
00:11:45,121 --> 00:11:48,290
<i>Opet razmišljam o tome!</i>

72
00:11:49,125 --> 00:11:51,544
Muči li te još nešto osim zubi?

73
00:12:02,972 --> 00:12:05,182
Yumeka, tvoja frizura...

74
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:10,187
Hladno je kad imaš kratku kosu
u ovo doba godine.

75
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:14,191
Ali kosa smeta kad igraš košarku.

76
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:19,488
Možda sam zahrđala,

77
00:12:20,072 --> 00:12:23,075
ali mislila sam se pridružiti
školskoj ekipi.

78
00:12:24,285 --> 00:12:25,827
Shvaćam.

79
00:12:25,828 --> 00:12:30,499
Morat ću raditi kao luda
mislim li dostići Natsu.

80
00:12:33,002 --> 00:12:36,172
<i>Jesam li ja to uskrisio
njezinu najveću suparnicu?</i>

81
00:12:36,839 --> 00:12:41,050
Zato moraš podržavati Natsu,

82
00:12:41,051 --> 00:12:42,761
da ne trati vrijeme kao ja nekad.

83
00:12:43,637 --> 00:12:45,264
Ti si joj ipak dečko.

84
00:12:49,852 --> 00:12:52,271
- Mi nismo par!
- Molim?!

85
00:12:53,063 --> 00:12:55,774
Pogrešno si shvatila!

86
00:12:56,484 --> 00:12:58,777
I ti imaš dečka?

87
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:01,989
<i>Čekaj, nisam je ispravio?</i>

88
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:04,158
Što?!

89
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:08,203
Dakle, nisi joj čak ni dečko,

90
00:13:08,204 --> 00:13:12,124
a silno si se trudio
da osvojiš onu ulaznicu.

91
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,502
Oprosti.

92
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:17,338
Osjećaš nešto prema njoj, zar ne?

93
00:13:18,923 --> 00:13:19,924
Pa...

94
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,009
Odbila te?

95
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:26,013
Još joj nisam rekao što osjećam.

96
00:13:26,722 --> 00:13:28,848
Veća si kukavica od burgera od piletine.

97
00:13:28,849 --> 00:13:30,808
PILETINA

98
00:13:30,809 --> 00:13:32,269
Zašto burgera?

99
00:13:32,895 --> 00:13:36,148
Ali Natsu nije lako pročitati.

100
00:13:37,066 --> 00:13:39,652
Mislila sam da je uopće ne zanimaju veze.

101
00:13:40,361 --> 00:13:41,946
U tome je stvar.

102
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:45,241
Ne traži izlike.

103
00:13:53,666 --> 00:13:56,252
<i>Ljubav je najsnažniji osjećaj, znaš?</i>

104
00:13:59,088 --> 00:14:01,507
{\an8}<i>Sljedećeg su dana Chinatsu i njezina ekipa</i>

105
00:14:02,466 --> 00:14:05,260
{\an8}<i>ispale u trećem krugu.</i>

106
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:08,346
{\an8}<i>Njihove su protivnice osvojile turnir.</i>

107
00:14:08,347 --> 00:14:09,264
{\an8}PRVAKINJE

108
00:14:09,265 --> 00:14:11,684
<i>Unatoč frustrirajućem porazu,</i>

109
00:14:12,309 --> 00:14:16,397
<i>imale su osjećaj
da su bile bolje nego prošli put.</i>

110
00:14:17,773 --> 00:14:21,318
<i>Usred svega toga nisam je stigao pitati...</i>

111
00:14:22,778 --> 00:14:25,781
<i>što je značio onaj zagrljaj.</i>

112
00:14:40,838 --> 00:14:44,632
Tvoji roditelji stižu u Japan
u 20 h, zar ne?

113
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:48,136
Da. Mislila sam poći pred njih u 18 h.

114
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:51,432
Onda ćeš posjetiti djeda u Naganu

115
00:14:52,057 --> 00:14:53,934
i biti ondje do nove godine?

116
00:14:54,602 --> 00:14:56,979
Nedostajat ćeš nam!

117
00:14:57,521 --> 00:14:58,771
Dobro jutro.

118
00:14:58,772 --> 00:15:03,027
Kakva ti je to frizura? Sredi se!

119
00:15:12,369 --> 00:15:13,871
Idem oprati kosu!

120
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:16,582
Oćelavjet ćeš budeš li je previše prao.

121
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:26,592
<i>Kako da se ponašam kraj nje?</i>

122
00:15:27,176 --> 00:15:30,054
<i>Ne mogu razgovarati s njom dok je mama tu.</i>

123
00:15:36,268 --> 00:15:37,561
<i>Kako je krenulo...</i>

124
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:44,777
Vrijeme je za godišnje čišćenje.

125
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,654
Želim da sve blista!

126
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:49,448
- Da, gospodine!
- Da, gospodine!

127
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:55,454
Taiki, ovdje smo završili,
možeš li ići pomoći negdje drugdje?

128
00:15:56,038 --> 00:15:56,956
Može!

129
00:16:04,546 --> 00:16:07,967
<i>Ona se ponaša
kao da se ništa nije dogodilo.</i>

130
00:16:08,801 --> 00:16:10,803
<i>Je li sve bio samo san?</i>

131
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:19,018
Zašto je ne bismo ostavili cijelu godinu?

132
00:16:19,019 --> 00:16:21,230
- Što?
- Hej, ti!

133
00:16:22,272 --> 00:16:23,983
Ne briši kružnim pokretima!

134
00:16:24,566 --> 00:16:27,193
Pomiči ruke pravocrtno, gore-dolje!

135
00:16:27,194 --> 00:16:29,238
I ne zaboravi prašinu u kutovima!

136
00:16:29,905 --> 00:16:32,740
{\an8}Pokažite se, zle mrlje!

137
00:16:32,741 --> 00:16:35,201
{\an8}Menadžerica stvarno cjepidlači.

138
00:16:35,202 --> 00:16:37,578
{\an8}Bio sam sretan
što imamo slatku menadžericu,

139
00:16:37,579 --> 00:16:38,998
{\an8}ali stroža je od moje mame!

140
00:16:39,581 --> 00:16:42,333
- Ne besposličari, Inota.
- Samo sam...

141
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:46,255
Ako si ovdje završio, baci se na opremu!

142
00:16:51,844 --> 00:16:55,264
<i>Ne mogu vjerovati
da smo ovdje proveli Badnjak.</i>

143
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:58,350
<i>Možda sam stvarno sve sanjao.</i>

144
00:17:01,937 --> 00:17:03,022
Hej, mali.

145
00:17:03,814 --> 00:17:04,981
Bio si dobar.

146
00:17:04,982 --> 00:17:06,734
Hvala, i ti.

147
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:10,778
Mislim da je to sve.

148
00:17:10,779 --> 00:17:12,488
U pravu si.

149
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:13,490
Da.

150
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:15,534
<i>Vidiš?</i>

151
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:18,454
<i>Chinatsu Senpai se normalno ponaša.</i>

152
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:21,456
<i>Kao da me nije zagrlila.</i>

153
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:23,042
Oprostite, prolazim.

154
00:17:35,345 --> 00:17:36,472
Oprosti!

155
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:39,850
Ne smeta mi.

156
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:41,935
Oprosti.

157
00:17:44,563 --> 00:17:47,398
Idem ovo predati.
Vi imate sve pod kontrolom?

158
00:17:47,399 --> 00:17:48,400
Svakako.

159
00:18:00,537 --> 00:18:02,998
Što se tiče onoga otprije...

160
00:18:06,293 --> 00:18:07,294
Jesi li se uvrijedio?

161
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:18,180
<i>Ne, nisam...</i>

162
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:22,850
- Ja...
- Hej!

163
00:18:22,851 --> 00:18:25,604
Dobili smo sok!

164
00:18:34,071 --> 00:18:35,781
<i>Naravno da se nisam uvrijedio!</i>

165
00:18:37,282 --> 00:18:38,408
<i>Ne.</i>

166
00:18:40,369 --> 00:18:41,453
<i>Pogriješila si!</i>

167
00:18:51,004 --> 00:18:53,924
Možeš li mi pomoći s ovime, Chono?

168
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,800
Što?

169
00:18:55,801 --> 00:18:57,052
Nosimo to u zbornicu.

170
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:00,055
Prilično je teško.

171
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:04,433
Da, valjda. Nisam znala da si toliko slab.

172
00:19:04,434 --> 00:19:07,146
- Ti vježbaš, doduše.
- A ti ne?

173
00:19:20,159 --> 00:19:23,161
Dobar je osjećaj sve očistiti!

174
00:19:23,162 --> 00:19:25,079
- Želite li da odemo nešto...
- Bok!

175
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:26,081
Hej!

176
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,171
<i>Moram razgovarati s njom!</i>

177
00:19:35,215 --> 00:19:36,592
<i>Reći da se nisam uvrijedio.</i>

178
00:19:38,302 --> 00:19:39,428
<i>Da me to usrećilo.</i>

179
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:44,349
<i>To je prvi put da me zagrlio
netko tko mi se sviđa!</i>

180
00:20:22,763 --> 00:20:25,224
Hvala ti.

181
00:20:50,666 --> 00:20:54,544
<i>Ne mogu prestati razmišljati
o tom trenutku.</i>

182
00:21:01,343 --> 00:21:02,344
<i>Ali...</i>

183
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,141
<i>Ali...</i>

184
00:21:12,646 --> 00:21:15,565
<i>Moram joj reći izravno!</i>

185
00:21:25,325 --> 00:21:26,326
Stigao sam!

186
00:21:27,077 --> 00:21:29,912
Polako, čemu žurba?

187
00:21:29,913 --> 00:21:32,833
- Gdje je Chinatsu Senpai?
- Već je otišla.

188
00:21:35,419 --> 00:21:37,796
Avion njezinih roditelja došao je ranije.

189
00:21:38,297 --> 00:21:40,424
Tvoj tata ju je odvezao na aerodrom.

190
00:21:43,552 --> 00:21:46,221
Zašto?

191
00:21:52,060 --> 00:21:54,896
<i>Zašto nije mogla biti tu?</i>

192
00:23:48,927 --> 00:23:53,932
{\an8}Prijevod titlova: Srđan Kos

